    ns1:alignmentBasis "Activity-derived proposal"@en ;
    ns1:applicabilityCondition "Inspect approved policy or control requirements that explicitly distinguish access authorization from permitted reuse. Test any resulting authentication and authorization procedure for identified resources (A1.2) and inspect the clear, accessible usage licence attached to data and metadata (R1.1). An ethics statement, privacy notice or generic compliance metric alone is insufficient."@en ;
    ns1:assessmentStatus "Proposed; no implementation or compliance asserted"@en ;
    ns1:evidenceRequirement "Inspect approved policy or control requirements that explicitly distinguish access authorization from permitted reuse. Test any resulting authentication and authorization procedure for identified resources (A1.2) and inspect the clear, accessible usage licence attached to data and metadata (R1.1). An ethics statement, privacy notice or generic compliance metric alone is insufficient."@en ;
    ns1:fromPractice <https://github.com/chris-day/FAIR-DAMA/blob/main/artefacts/dama-fair-mapping.ttl#activity/DataHandlingEthics/row-2> ;
    ns1:rationale "Review can identify gaps in authorized access and permitted reuse if the review criteria explicitly include them."@en ;
    ns1:targetsPrinciple <https://w3id.org/fair/principles/terms/R1.1> ;
    ns1:viaPractice ns1:AttachUsageLicense .

<https://github.com/chris-day/FAIR-DAMA/blob/main/artefacts/dama-fair-mapping.ttl#contribution/DataHandlingEthics/row-3/indirect/A1.2> a owl:NamedIndividual,
        ns1:IndirectContribution ;
    rdfs:label "Identify Principles, Practices, and Risk Factors → A1.2"@en ;
    dcterms:source <https://github.com/chris-day/FAIR-DAMA/blob/main/artefacts/outputs/dama-20261116/DAMA-PDOC_FAIR-MASTER_2026-11-16_V3.xlsx#DataHandlingEthics!A3:L3> ;
    ns1:alignmentBasis "Activity-derived proposal"@en ;
    ns1:applicabilityCondition "Inspect approved policy or control requirements that explicitly distinguish access authorization from permitted reuse. Test any resulting authentication and authorization procedure for identified resources (A1.2) and inspect the clear, accessible usage licence attached to data and metadata (R1.1). An ethics statement, privacy notice or generic compliance metric alone is insufficient."@en ;
    ns1:assessmentStatus "Proposed; no implementation or compliance asserted"@en ;
    ns1:evidenceRequirement "Inspect approved policy or control requirements that explicitly distinguish access authorization from permitted reuse. Test any resulting authentication and authorization procedure for identified resources (A1.2) and inspect the clear, accessible usage licence attached to data and metadata (R1.1). An ethics statement, privacy notice or generic compliance metric alone is insufficient."@en ;
