    ns1:rationale "Risk assessment can establish requirements for controlled access and clear reuse permissions; neither requirement is specified by the activity label alone."@en ;
    ns1:targetsPrinciple <https://w3id.org/fair/principles/terms/A1.2> ;
    ns1:viaPractice ns1:ConfigureRetrievalAuthorization .

